cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PRiSM in published work, please cite the paper below."
title: "PRiSM (Partial Responses in Structured Models): a Python framework for converting probabilistic binary classifiers into auditable nomograms"
abstract: "PRiSM is a model-agnostic framework that converts a trained probabilistic binary classifier for tabular data into a standalone nomogram that can be audited term by term."
type: software
